website/**
examples/**
CHANGELOG.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
SECURITY.md
README.OSS.md
docs/MAINTAINING.md
docs/ROADMAP_BEHAVIORAL_PROOF.md

# Keep: out/**, webview-ui/dist/**, package.json, README.md, docs/**
